			"notes": "- Fixed Grapple Winch Cables rendering completely dark\n- Mobs with AI disabled are now considered heavy - because they can't be moved\n- \"Spidey\" advancement now requires the player to be moving in order for it to trigger\n- Grapple Winch now takes durability damage when disconnecting\n- Improved compatibility of Steel Cable Shears (They now extend ShearsItem)\n- Reworked Rubber progression / Removed Molten Rubber items\n- Removed Item Cooling\n- Fixed Steel Hammer & Steel Cleaver consuming more durability than they should when fighting mobs\n- Steel Wrench now prioritizes picking blocks up into the player's offhand if it's available\n- Added Copper Nugget\n- Added various recycling recipes\n- Default Item Enchantments properly bake on non-host clients\n- Grapple Winch Cable now properly renders in an X\n- Grapple Claws no longer turn to face south when hooking onto an entity"
		},
