			"notes": "Hi again! I'm finished with my college stuff, so expect to see a good deal more activity here! \nThis release reworks a lot of KLAXON's logic, including removing unnecessary networking, fixing minor annoyances, and adding Blast Processor Behaviors! Like Dispenser Behaviors, these allow for incredible customizability of the Blast Processor's functions based off of the current catalyst item! Currently, this system has support for Fireworks and Firework Stars, and will spawn and detonate a firework instantly if one is used as a catalyst.\n\n1.21 support and a NeoForge port are coming sometime, probably!"
